<title>PERU: Peru's Atacocha Q1 net 3.1 mln soles.</title>
<headline>Peru's Atacocha Q1 net 3.1 mln soles.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net - 3.1 million soles vs 625,000 soles loss</p>
<p>Revs - 25.4 million soles vs 12.8 million soles</p>
<p>NOTE: Compania Minera Atacocha SA is a polymetallic miner.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
